    },
    "regime_ic": {"2020-2024": 0.026297, "2025-2027": 0.033700, "2028-2029": 0.029408, "2030-11-12": 0.012378},
    "regime_notes": "Positive five-day IC in every evaluated regime; latest regime is weaker and the 15-asset cross-section implies material IC uncertainty. Ten-day IC is positive but below the ICIR admission gate.",
